    {
      "text": "ちょうのうりょくで　じぶんと　あいての\nぼうぎょと　とくぼうの\nのうりょく　へんかを　いれかえる。",
      "version_group": {
        "name": "sword-shield",
        "url": "/api/v2/version-group/20/"
      },
      "language": {
        "name": "ja-hrkt",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/1/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "초능력으로 자신과 상대의\n방어와 특수방어의\n능력 변화를 교체한다.",
      "version_group": {
        "name": "sword-shield",
        "url": "/api/v2/version-group/20/"
      },
      "language": {
        "name": "ko",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/3/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "用超能力將自己和對手的\n防禦與特防的能力變化互相交換。",
      "version_group": {
        "name": "sword-shield",
        "url": "/api/v2/version-group/20/"
      },
      "language": {
        "name": "zh-hant",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/4/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "Pouvoir qui échange les modifications de la Défense\nSpéciale et de la Défense avec la cible.",
      "version_group": {
        "name": "sword-shield",
        "url": "/api/v2/version-group/20/"
      },
      "language": {
        "name": "fr",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/5/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "Psychische Kräfte tauschen Änderungen an Verteidigung\nund Spezial-Verteidigung mit denen des Zieles.",
      "version_group": {
        "name": "sword-shield",
        "url": "/api/v2/version-group/20/"
      },
      "language": {
        "name": "de",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/6/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "El usuario emplea su poder mental para intercambiar\nlos cambios en la Defensa y Defensa Especial con el\nobjetivo.",
      "version_group": {
        "name": "sword-shield",
        "url": "/api/v2/version-group/20/"
      },
      "language": {
        "name": "es",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/7/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "Chi la usa sfrutta la sua forza psichica per scambiare\nle modifiche a Difesa e Difesa Speciale con il bersaglio.",
      "version_group": {
        "name": "sword-shield",
        "url": "/api/v2/version-group/20/"
      },
      "language": {
        "name": "it",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/8/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "The user employs its psychic power to switch\nchanges to its Defense and Sp. Def stats with\nthe target.",
